WEBVTT

00:22.000 --> 00:26.120
PROSPERITY

00:26.200 --> 00:30.320
PROSPERITY

01:04.920 --> 01:05.840
Zhuang Yan.

01:06.920 --> 01:07.960
He Niaoniao.

01:08.520 --> 01:10.360
Tomorrow, both of you
will return to school.

01:11.160 --> 01:12.120
Resume your studies.

01:13.760 --> 01:15.840
Mom, I…

01:15.920 --> 01:18.120
You guys don't need to worry
about the family.

01:19.400 --> 01:21.200
It has already been more than a week.

01:21.760 --> 01:23.640
The living have to resume their lives.

01:23.720 --> 01:25.000
I'm quitting school.

01:26.440 --> 01:27.320
How dare you?

01:27.920 --> 01:30.000
I've left our study group's group chat.

01:31.040 --> 01:31.880
Why?

01:34.720 --> 01:35.600
They said

01:36.280 --> 01:38.280
that the women in our family
jinx their husbands.

01:42.880 --> 01:45.160
I didn't say that. They were saying that.

01:54.000 --> 01:55.480
People have their own opinions.

01:55.560 --> 01:56.720
We can't control them.

01:57.400 --> 01:59.280
However, we can choose
how to live our lives.

01:59.920 --> 02:00.840
Let's just ignore them.

02:04.520 --> 02:05.440
He Niaoniao,

02:06.800 --> 02:08.360
if you're still my daughter,

02:08.440 --> 02:10.720
you need to go
to school with your head up.

02:12.080 --> 02:13.160
Show everyone

02:14.560 --> 02:16.000
how our family of jinxes

02:16.080 --> 02:17.720
can survive without men.

02:18.240 --> 02:19.080
Mom,

02:19.160 --> 02:20.280
I'm still here.

02:20.840 --> 02:22.680
I can quit school and help out.

02:22.760 --> 02:23.640
-No.
-No.

02:28.600 --> 02:30.000
If you dare to mention again

02:30.080 --> 02:31.560
that you're quitting school,

02:32.320 --> 02:33.440
I'll break your legs.

02:35.560 --> 02:36.480
Besides,

02:36.560 --> 02:38.840
braising chickens
is not what your hands are for.

02:42.000 --> 02:43.960
You and He Niaoniao
need to focus on your studies.

02:44.040 --> 02:45.800
It'll be the biggest favor
you can do for me.

02:46.600 --> 02:47.600
Did you hear me?

03:12.760 --> 03:15.360
In the past, I didn't think
He Zhangyue was a talkative person.

03:16.560 --> 03:17.920
But why is the house so quiet

03:18.960 --> 03:20.160
without him around?

04:51.000 --> 04:55.840
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

05:17.240 --> 05:18.240
Therefore, Zhuang Jie,

05:20.480 --> 05:21.560
the nature of loss

05:22.720 --> 05:24.840
teaches us to slowly accept.

05:27.720 --> 05:29.040
I know you are suffering.

05:31.760 --> 05:33.000
But you will get through it.

05:51.960 --> 05:53.920
Those who are meant to leave
will eventually leave.

05:54.920 --> 05:56.040
We can't keep them.

05:58.600 --> 05:59.720
Being mortal,

06:02.680 --> 06:04.040
we can only lessen our grief.

06:51.240 --> 06:52.440
Mom.

06:52.520 --> 06:53.720
Let me do it.

06:53.800 --> 06:54.720
Go to sleep.

06:55.760 --> 06:56.800
I'm not sleepy.

07:00.000 --> 07:01.400
Even so, you need to sleep.

07:01.480 --> 07:03.360
We're reopening the chicken shop tomorrow.

07:04.680 --> 07:06.400
You'll return to Shanghai tomorrow, right?

07:08.160 --> 07:09.640
Focus on your work when you're there.

07:09.720 --> 07:10.800
Don't worry about me.

07:14.480 --> 07:16.560
I'll go back and hand over my work.

07:17.040 --> 07:18.720
I'll pack my usual belongings

07:18.800 --> 07:19.960
and be back soon.

07:21.240 --> 07:22.920
Why would you come back?

07:23.520 --> 07:25.920
Didn't I say I don't need you?

07:26.000 --> 07:26.880
Mom,

07:27.560 --> 07:29.240
I'm no longer 12.

07:30.040 --> 07:31.680
Even so, you're still a child to me.

07:31.760 --> 07:33.080
I said I don't need your help.

07:36.440 --> 07:39.000
Do you think you're the only stubborn one
in the family?

07:39.600 --> 07:41.120
I'm coming back no matter what you say.

08:09.480 --> 08:10.360
Mom.

08:14.560 --> 08:15.920
Since it has already come to this,

08:17.680 --> 08:18.600
we can only

08:19.600 --> 08:20.920
depend on ourselves now.

08:23.920 --> 08:25.440
We'll definitely get over it.

08:29.280 --> 08:30.120
I know that.

08:58.480 --> 09:00.320
Here you go.
I've gathered your things for you.

09:00.400 --> 09:01.960
See if there's anything else you need.

09:02.680 --> 09:04.480
But even if you leave anything behind,

09:04.560 --> 09:06.080
I can send it to you.

09:12.120 --> 09:14.400
You can cry if you want to.

09:15.120 --> 09:16.480
There's no need to hold it in.

09:19.960 --> 09:21.080
I'm not going to cry.

09:21.880 --> 09:22.880
It's pointless.

09:31.240 --> 09:33.560
Head back and keep your mom company.

09:34.880 --> 09:36.520
You can come back after things are settled

09:36.600 --> 09:38.120
at the factory and the shop.

09:39.240 --> 09:41.160
I'll keep an eye on things in the office.

09:41.840 --> 09:43.560
I'll update you
with the latest client info

09:43.640 --> 09:45.120
and industry news.

09:46.440 --> 09:48.800
I'll make sure you won't lag behind
when you come back.

09:54.400 --> 09:56.640
I'll go to the office tomorrow
and do my job handover.

10:02.120 --> 10:02.960
Zhuang Jie,

10:04.960 --> 10:07.800
not everyone may be able
to sympathize with your grief.

10:08.480 --> 10:11.120
You can show your friends and families
your weak side.

10:12.040 --> 10:14.920
But in the office,
you have to show them who the boss is.

10:15.000 --> 10:16.920
Don't let those
who are eyeing your position

10:17.000 --> 10:18.000
think that you're weak

10:18.080 --> 10:19.280
and won't be returning.

10:19.360 --> 10:21.640
Don't worry. I know what to do.

10:28.520 --> 10:31.080
I'll be taking a temporary leave.
You'll be on your own.

10:31.160 --> 10:33.160
Both offense and defense
are vital in our sector.

10:33.240 --> 10:35.160
Not only do we have
to compete with our peers

10:35.240 --> 10:36.600
but also retain our clients.

10:36.680 --> 10:37.520
But remember this.

10:37.600 --> 10:38.920
No matter what you do,

10:39.000 --> 10:40.320
you mustn't cross the bottom line.

10:40.400 --> 10:42.760
Don't destroy the industry's environment.

10:42.840 --> 10:44.000
Only if the pie is big enough

10:44.080 --> 10:45.840
can each of us
receive a bigger piece of it.

10:45.920 --> 10:46.920
Ms. Zhuang, don't worry.

10:47.000 --> 10:47.880
We won't let you down.

10:47.960 --> 10:49.080
We'll do a good job.

10:50.320 --> 10:51.520
Sales experts

10:51.600 --> 10:53.440
are people who go to extremes

10:53.520 --> 10:55.200
to accomplish something simple.

10:55.280 --> 10:57.240
For example, when you promote a product,

10:57.320 --> 10:59.280
not only do you have
to know theories and data,

10:59.360 --> 11:01.720
but you also have to know
how to bundle them into a set

11:01.800 --> 11:03.480
and what similar products
are on the market.

11:03.560 --> 11:05.520
You even need to know
your clients' transactions

11:05.600 --> 11:07.160
and their medical insurance information,

11:07.240 --> 11:09.320
and organize and analyze them.

11:09.400 --> 11:10.360
Any other questions?

11:14.120 --> 11:15.400
Ms. Zhuang, are you leaving now?

11:16.720 --> 11:17.640
Is there anything else?

11:19.200 --> 11:21.240
I made a request
to our superior yesterday.

11:21.320 --> 11:22.520
I want to use your desk

11:22.600 --> 11:23.640
during your absence.

11:24.480 --> 11:25.520
As you know,

11:25.600 --> 11:27.640
newcomers don't even get their own desks.

11:29.320 --> 11:30.720
But I have no other intentions.

11:30.800 --> 11:32.680
I want to get some luck
from the top salesperson.

11:36.360 --> 11:38.280
If our superior is fine with it,
I'm fine with it.

11:39.120 --> 11:40.640
But first, I need to correct you.

11:40.720 --> 11:42.840
You can't become a top salesperson
with luck alone.

11:42.920 --> 11:45.120
If not, all of my experiences
would've been in vain.

11:46.040 --> 11:47.120
You may take my seat for now

11:47.200 --> 11:48.720
but don't leave too many personal items,

11:48.800 --> 11:50.880
or else, it'll be troublesome
for you to clear them away

11:50.960 --> 11:51.960
when I get back.

11:52.040 --> 11:53.120
Of course.

11:54.840 --> 11:56.080
Ms. Zhuang, don't overthink it.

11:57.600 --> 11:58.440
Jia,

11:59.000 --> 12:00.760
I was never the one to overthink it.

12:02.120 --> 12:03.040
I understand you.

12:03.120 --> 12:04.600
You're young and ambitious.

12:05.240 --> 12:07.520
From a certain perspective,
this is actually a strength.

12:08.960 --> 12:10.480
But remember what I said.

12:11.480 --> 12:13.840
You can only travel far
if you don't cross the bottom line.

12:14.840 --> 12:16.400
I've been working for many years.

12:16.480 --> 12:18.440
I hate the term "rat race" the most.

12:19.440 --> 12:20.440
One's ability shows

12:20.520 --> 12:22.200
whether they stay
at the top or the bottom.

12:23.640 --> 12:24.960
You're very intelligent.

12:25.600 --> 12:26.880
But there might be some lessons

12:27.480 --> 12:29.200
you'll only get to learn in the future.

12:30.880 --> 12:31.720
Mom.

12:32.880 --> 12:34.400
Mom, calm down.

12:34.480 --> 12:35.640
Slow down.

12:35.720 --> 12:36.840
Who is missing?

12:36.920 --> 12:38.600
NEWEY NAISON MEDICAL COMPANY

12:38.680 --> 12:40.240
Has He Niaoniao run away from home?

12:41.120 --> 12:42.000
If not for my dad,

12:42.080 --> 12:43.760
I would've run away from home long ago.

12:49.480 --> 12:50.320
Mom,

12:51.080 --> 12:52.280
Niaoniao is a witty girl.

12:52.360 --> 12:53.640
You know that.

12:53.720 --> 12:56.320
I'll actually be impressed
if she can travel to Shanghai alone.

12:56.400 --> 12:58.560
Calm down. I'll inquire
about her at the train station.

12:58.640 --> 13:00.240
Staff nowadays are very responsible.

13:00.320 --> 13:01.520
They will surely question her

13:01.600 --> 13:03.440
if they see a little girl traveling alone.

13:03.520 --> 13:05.320
You should calm down. Don't fret.

13:05.400 --> 13:07.000
I'll update you later.

13:17.760 --> 13:18.600
Who is this?

13:19.760 --> 13:20.640
Chen Maidong?

13:53.120 --> 13:53.960
He Niaoniao.

13:54.040 --> 13:55.760
What are you up to?

13:56.480 --> 13:57.600
Did you up and leave

13:57.680 --> 13:58.640
after leaving a mere note?

13:58.720 --> 14:00.440
Did you know
that Mom is worried about you?

14:00.520 --> 14:01.520
How could you…

14:01.600 --> 14:03.240
How could you be so bold?

14:03.320 --> 14:04.200
Isn't she safe now?

14:05.000 --> 14:06.360
We can only call this a close call.

14:06.440 --> 14:08.120
It would be too late
if something happened.

14:08.680 --> 14:10.200
First, inform Ms. Liao that she's safe.

14:15.760 --> 14:17.600
How did you find her?

14:17.680 --> 14:18.960
I came to Shanghai for a meeting.

14:19.040 --> 14:20.400
I happened to see her on the train.

14:21.080 --> 14:22.400
Thank you so much.

14:22.480 --> 14:23.680
I was so worried about her.

14:25.800 --> 14:26.920
Don't mention it.

14:27.000 --> 14:28.240
Talk it over with her.

14:30.840 --> 14:31.920
Well,

14:32.000 --> 14:33.080
I'll make a move first.

14:34.280 --> 14:35.480
Do you have something urgent?

14:37.480 --> 14:38.440
I…

14:39.360 --> 14:40.480
It's not that urgent.

14:43.640 --> 14:45.280
If so, do you want

14:45.880 --> 14:47.520
to have a beverage?

14:48.240 --> 14:49.280
I'm too busy

14:49.360 --> 14:50.360
to buy you a meal now.

14:51.800 --> 14:52.640
If you're around,

14:52.720 --> 14:53.920
at least I won't beat her up

14:54.000 --> 14:54.960
out of frustration.

14:57.360 --> 14:58.640
Do you always

14:58.720 --> 14:59.920
beat up your sister?

15:02.520 --> 15:04.400
I can start learning how to.

15:40.360 --> 15:41.200
Niaoniao.

15:42.960 --> 15:44.200
What's wrong with you?

15:45.480 --> 15:46.600
Why did you do that?

15:48.320 --> 15:49.240
The house felt cold.

15:52.240 --> 15:53.120
What do you mean?

15:55.480 --> 15:56.640
I have the feeling

15:57.600 --> 15:58.720
that Dad is still home.

15:59.760 --> 16:01.040
He wants to take me with him.

16:08.840 --> 16:09.920
He Niaoniao,

16:10.000 --> 16:11.440
don't let your imagination run wild.

16:12.160 --> 16:13.440
Mr. He doted on you so much.

16:13.520 --> 16:14.680
Why would he take you away?

16:14.760 --> 16:16.160
Precisely because he doted on me,

16:16.240 --> 16:17.920
he wants me to keep him company.

16:25.120 --> 16:26.600
Didn't you guys say

16:27.240 --> 16:28.760
that he went to a better place?

16:34.120 --> 16:35.280
To be honest,

16:37.880 --> 16:39.360
I wanted to leave with Dad.

16:41.000 --> 16:42.680
But I didn't know
how to explain it to Mom.

16:42.760 --> 16:43.600
He Niaoniao,

16:44.360 --> 16:45.880
you're getting ridiculous here.

16:46.680 --> 16:48.600
Why are you so disrespectful
of a child's senses?

16:49.720 --> 16:51.240
I know that Dad is still around.

16:51.320 --> 16:52.720
He keeps talking to me.

16:56.880 --> 16:58.080
Niaoniao,

16:59.120 --> 17:00.520
why would I disrespect you?

17:03.640 --> 17:05.800
I was the same as you

17:05.880 --> 17:06.720
when I was your age.

17:08.480 --> 17:10.000
But we mustn't think that way.

17:11.839 --> 17:13.119
Even if we were both 12

17:14.480 --> 17:15.599
when we lost our fathers,

17:19.440 --> 17:20.560
you're not me.

17:21.760 --> 17:23.119
You'll never feel what I feel.

18:07.040 --> 18:07.880
Niaoniao,

18:09.600 --> 18:10.760
your feeling

18:10.840 --> 18:12.280
might not be a hallucination.

18:15.280 --> 18:17.000
Everything in the world

18:18.760 --> 18:20.120
is made up of atoms,

18:20.200 --> 18:21.400
including humans.

18:23.400 --> 18:24.560
From a certain perspective,

18:25.480 --> 18:26.880
it's a type of energy.

18:28.120 --> 18:29.480
It's just that we can't see it

18:29.560 --> 18:30.440
or touch it.

18:32.960 --> 18:35.200
Your father, whom you spent
most of your time with,

18:35.280 --> 18:36.960
is just existing in another form.

18:38.160 --> 18:39.840
That's why it's normal for you

18:39.920 --> 18:40.880
to sense his presence.

18:44.280 --> 18:46.200
So my dad is still in the house, right?

18:48.840 --> 18:50.120
He'll always be in your heart.

18:51.280 --> 18:52.400
That is way more important.

18:54.840 --> 18:56.840
But I want to tap into my dad's frequency.

18:56.920 --> 18:59.240
I want to tell him that I miss him

18:59.320 --> 19:00.440
and can't forget about him.

19:03.400 --> 19:06.160
Some words your dad will be able to sense

19:07.200 --> 19:08.880
even if you don't say them out loud.

19:10.680 --> 19:12.520
He must be very worried about you

19:13.880 --> 19:15.240
because his sudden departure

19:16.280 --> 19:17.280
is a huge blow

19:17.880 --> 19:19.280
to your entire family.

19:22.360 --> 19:24.280
We have many subjects we have to study

19:24.360 --> 19:25.520
when we go to school.

19:27.080 --> 19:29.080
However, no one
ever taught us about death.

19:31.960 --> 19:33.360
Death sucks.

19:34.120 --> 19:35.760
Why must I study such a subject?

19:39.880 --> 19:40.720
Niaoniao,

19:42.640 --> 19:43.600
death is actually

19:44.880 --> 19:47.520
a long game of hide-and-seek.

19:48.800 --> 19:50.400
Although you can't find your dad now,

19:51.080 --> 19:53.200
that doesn't mean
there's no point in living.

19:55.080 --> 19:56.560
Since your dad is hiding right now,

19:57.480 --> 19:59.000
you should cherish

19:59.600 --> 20:00.960
your other family members more.

20:03.600 --> 20:04.440
Don't you think so?

20:08.960 --> 20:09.880
If so,

20:11.640 --> 20:13.280
is my dad doing okay now?

20:14.440 --> 20:15.640
Is he still suffering?

20:24.040 --> 20:24.880
I'm sorry.

20:26.960 --> 20:28.000
I have no idea either.

20:31.280 --> 20:32.680
But from a professional perspective,

20:33.640 --> 20:35.280
for those who just departed
from the world,

20:36.320 --> 20:39.360
their bodies aren't remains or remnants.

20:41.200 --> 20:43.120
Rather, they are experiencing

20:43.200 --> 20:44.800
some sort of change, nurturing,

20:44.880 --> 20:45.800
and the hatching

20:46.640 --> 20:47.800
of a new form of life.

21:23.880 --> 21:25.640
"Scientists once made an educated guess

21:27.280 --> 21:29.160
about the moment people depart
from this world.

21:30.880 --> 21:32.280
The billions of atoms within you

21:32.360 --> 21:33.280
start to drift apart.

21:34.360 --> 21:36.320
They're no longer confined
to the human form.

21:37.720 --> 21:39.280
The parts that make up the human body

21:39.360 --> 21:41.000
are taken apart one by one

21:41.960 --> 21:44.560
as the human breathes one last time.

21:45.640 --> 21:47.200
These atoms start to disintegrate

21:48.240 --> 21:49.840
and merge into the surrounding land.

21:51.600 --> 21:53.440
The atoms form something new.

21:54.760 --> 21:57.040
They became the leaves of sunflowers,

21:57.680 --> 21:58.960
the spotted snails,

22:00.040 --> 22:01.440
the husk of corn,

22:01.520 --> 22:02.720
the upper jaw of an insect,

22:03.920 --> 22:06.040
and even the feather on a bird's tail.

22:06.960 --> 22:08.360
However, each of these atoms

22:09.160 --> 22:11.360
carries a mark of their previous lives.

22:13.120 --> 22:14.000
Therefore,

22:14.600 --> 22:16.160
life doesn't vanish.

22:17.120 --> 22:18.920
They only exist in another form.

22:19.600 --> 22:20.600
In the past you

22:21.440 --> 22:22.760
might embrace people,

22:23.600 --> 22:24.520
might smile,

22:25.040 --> 22:25.880
or frown.

22:27.560 --> 22:28.400
But now,

22:29.360 --> 22:30.760
you might have become

22:30.840 --> 22:32.400
the seaweed that dances with the waves,

22:33.880 --> 22:35.040
the swirling Mammatus clouds

22:35.120 --> 22:36.120
beneath the cumulonimbus,

22:37.760 --> 22:40.200
the fluttering silverfish as it lays eggs

22:41.400 --> 22:43.880
or a cobblestone gliding in a vortex.

22:45.880 --> 22:46.760
Your body

22:46.840 --> 22:48.640
can travel across the world,

22:49.440 --> 22:51.360
make the grassland crease,

22:52.120 --> 22:53.600
make the pine branches bend,

22:54.600 --> 22:56.840
and make the egrets flap their wings.

22:58.760 --> 22:59.800
All in all,

23:00.600 --> 23:02.440
the peak you wished to summit,

23:03.360 --> 23:04.880
the underwater world you wished to see,

23:05.440 --> 23:06.880
and the sky you wished to conquer,

23:08.280 --> 23:09.200
you can now

23:10.560 --> 23:12.280
achieve all of them easily."

23:58.080 --> 23:59.760
You didn't finish the story, right?

24:00.440 --> 24:01.440
What about the rest?

24:03.320 --> 24:05.200
I suggest you read the book yourself.

24:05.280 --> 24:06.760
Sum: Forty Tales from the Afterlives

24:06.840 --> 24:08.520
by David Eagleman.

24:15.760 --> 24:17.320
Do you wish to take a look around?

24:19.760 --> 24:21.440
The balcony has the best view.

24:21.520 --> 24:23.120
You can see the Oriental Pearl Tower.

24:27.320 --> 24:29.040
It's just a TV tower.

24:30.600 --> 24:31.680
What's so nice about it?

24:51.040 --> 24:51.880
Chen Maidong.

24:55.480 --> 24:56.760
Luckily, I know you well.

24:57.320 --> 24:59.280
If not, I would've been terrified by now.

25:00.160 --> 25:02.360
Do you have something against my lights?

25:03.400 --> 25:05.280
Warmth and light

25:06.120 --> 25:08.080
affect our emotions.

25:09.120 --> 25:11.560
Warm lighting softens the edges.

25:11.640 --> 25:12.880
It soothes one's nerves.

25:14.280 --> 25:15.400
You can try it

25:16.120 --> 25:17.240
when you're alone.

25:19.880 --> 25:20.760
I'll remember that.

25:26.040 --> 25:26.880
By the way,

25:31.320 --> 25:33.120
weren't you living together
with Wang Xixia?

25:33.680 --> 25:34.760
How did you know?

25:37.760 --> 25:39.600
I forgot which old classmate
told me about it.

25:41.880 --> 25:43.120
She hasn't returned yet.

25:44.200 --> 25:45.440
She went on a blind date.

25:47.600 --> 25:48.760
What?

25:48.840 --> 25:50.720
Do you think
city people don't go on blind dates

25:50.800 --> 25:52.200
and find our partners in bars?

25:58.920 --> 25:59.880
I'll be leaving now.

26:28.280 --> 26:29.160
Chen Maidong.

26:34.600 --> 26:35.480
Thank you.

26:37.920 --> 26:39.600
Be more patient toward your sister.

26:40.840 --> 26:42.520
Honesty is the cure for everything.

26:44.600 --> 26:46.000
Luckily, you were around today.

26:46.720 --> 26:49.040
Otherwise,
when her questions irritated me,

26:49.120 --> 26:50.640
I would've told her

26:50.720 --> 26:52.640
that Mr. He will definitely go to Heaven.

26:53.320 --> 26:55.480
If she wishes to get there,

26:55.560 --> 26:57.000
she has to pass the exam there.

26:57.080 --> 26:59.360
Those who don't study well
won't get to see their family.

27:01.080 --> 27:02.280
You should shut up.

27:05.440 --> 27:06.560
What about you?

27:07.640 --> 27:08.480
Are you okay?

27:09.680 --> 27:10.600
Yes.

27:12.480 --> 27:13.880
Didn't you tell me this before?

27:15.360 --> 27:16.560
Being mortal,

27:17.120 --> 27:18.640
we can only lessen our grief.

27:25.880 --> 27:27.560
You should take Niaoniao out for a walk.

27:28.680 --> 27:29.640
Both of you.

27:39.600 --> 27:41.560
Chen Maidong, you deleted me.

27:42.880 --> 27:43.760
What?

27:43.840 --> 27:44.680
WeChat.

27:45.200 --> 27:46.360
You unfriended me on WeChat.

27:55.640 --> 27:56.560
Fine.

27:57.280 --> 27:58.320
I'll add you again.

27:59.040 --> 28:00.120
It's in the past.

28:04.240 --> 28:05.520
What do you mean?

28:08.600 --> 28:09.600
The train station?

28:10.840 --> 28:11.720
The kiss?

28:12.680 --> 28:13.760
Your phone.

28:13.840 --> 28:14.920
Hurry up.

28:17.760 --> 28:20.360
You're good in all aspects,

28:20.440 --> 28:22.120
except for the fact that you're petty.

28:43.600 --> 28:44.840
Bye.

28:44.920 --> 28:45.880
Take care.

28:46.600 --> 28:47.440
Got it.

31:52.440 --> 31:55.640
NANPING NORTH STATION WELCOMES YOU

31:56.640 --> 31:57.800
Did you have fun today?

31:57.880 --> 31:59.040
Of course.

31:59.120 --> 32:00.320
Dad promised us several times

32:00.400 --> 32:02.680
that he would bring
our whole family to Disneyland.

32:02.760 --> 32:04.000
We'll enjoy his share

32:04.080 --> 32:05.400
on his behalf today.

32:05.480 --> 32:06.840
Not just today.

32:06.920 --> 32:07.760
From today onwards,

32:07.840 --> 32:09.040
we need to lead by example.

32:09.120 --> 32:10.760
We need to motivate Mom and Zhuang Yan

32:10.840 --> 32:12.840
and live our lives to the fullest
on Mr. He's behalf.

32:12.920 --> 32:13.800
Okay?

32:18.960 --> 32:21.120
By the way, that ride! My goodness!

32:33.480 --> 32:34.400
Straighten your back.

32:35.400 --> 32:36.800
-Jie, you're back.
-Hello, mister.

32:36.880 --> 32:37.920
When did you come back?

32:38.000 --> 32:38.840
-Just now.
-Just now.

32:40.000 --> 32:41.480
-You guys are back.
-We are back.

32:41.560 --> 32:43.400
-You guys are back.
-Hello, mister, madam.

32:52.480 --> 32:53.640
Mr. Zhang.

32:53.720 --> 32:54.640
Hello, Mr. Zhang.

32:55.920 --> 32:57.360
Girl, you're back.

32:57.440 --> 32:58.640
-Are you okay?
-I'm fine.

32:58.720 --> 33:00.640
Niaoniao, where did you go?

33:00.720 --> 33:02.520
-Shanghai.
-Shanghai?

33:02.600 --> 33:03.680
Shanghai Disneyland.

33:03.760 --> 33:04.800
-Really?
-Yes.

33:04.880 --> 33:05.720
You look so happy.

33:07.520 --> 33:08.840
It seems like she's okay now.

33:08.920 --> 33:10.040
She's okay now.

33:14.400 --> 33:15.440
Why aren't you asleep?

33:15.520 --> 33:16.960
Can you still move your leg?

33:18.240 --> 33:19.360
You guys toured the town

33:19.440 --> 33:20.960
like people who have lost their minds.

33:21.440 --> 33:22.880
I wonder who you were trying to show.

33:23.760 --> 33:25.120
I was telling the folks

33:25.200 --> 33:26.440
that I am back.

33:27.000 --> 33:28.280
The He family is doing fine.

33:28.360 --> 33:30.480
We're not a widow and orphans
that can be bullied.

33:31.240 --> 33:33.040
A flimsy lie reveals the truth.

33:33.920 --> 33:35.720
Enough. Go and take a bath.

33:36.320 --> 33:37.320
You can rest after that.

33:37.400 --> 33:38.760
What's the rush?

33:38.840 --> 33:40.040
Let's spend some time together.

33:42.640 --> 33:43.720
Is He Niaoniao asleep?

33:44.960 --> 33:45.880
Yes.

33:46.680 --> 33:48.760
Mom, you should stop being angry at her.

33:48.840 --> 33:49.880
She promised me

33:49.960 --> 33:51.520
that she won't do this again.

33:52.880 --> 33:56.080
She's far less sensible
than you were back then.

33:57.440 --> 33:59.400
Niaoniao is pretty sensible too.

33:59.480 --> 34:01.600
It's just that she's sensible
in a different way.

34:01.680 --> 34:03.000
I'm a terrible mother.

34:03.080 --> 34:05.240
All of you have had
to suffer together with me.

34:16.960 --> 34:17.840
Mom.

34:18.520 --> 34:20.159
Have you ever heard of the term "märchen"?

34:21.840 --> 34:23.679
What do you think?

34:25.400 --> 34:26.840
When it comes to foreign words,

34:26.920 --> 34:27.800
I only know "goodbye".

34:28.480 --> 34:29.719
I've done nothing else in life

34:29.800 --> 34:31.080
except say goodbye to others.

34:33.320 --> 34:34.639
I'm sure you've heard

34:34.719 --> 34:36.040
of the famous Grimms' Fairy Tales.

34:36.760 --> 34:39.000
The term "märchen" means fairy tale.

34:39.080 --> 34:40.239
It's a German word.

34:40.320 --> 34:42.280
The first storytellers were all women.

34:42.840 --> 34:44.000
As mothers,

34:44.080 --> 34:45.280
they hoped that their children

34:45.360 --> 34:48.080
could grow up in a pure and gentle world.

34:49.280 --> 34:51.000
Fairy tales always give people

34:51.080 --> 34:52.199
a notion of happiness

34:53.239 --> 34:54.360
that is unrealistic.

34:55.719 --> 34:56.920
I failed at that.

34:57.600 --> 34:59.040
I never believed in such things.

34:59.760 --> 35:01.960
I wasn't patient enough
to tell you guys fairy tales.

35:02.040 --> 35:03.560
Do you know who else in the world

35:03.640 --> 35:05.880
doesn't believe fairy tales
or even want to tell them?

35:05.960 --> 35:07.240
Who?

35:07.920 --> 35:08.800
Men.

35:11.800 --> 35:13.480
That's why, Mom,

35:13.560 --> 35:14.560
thank you

35:14.640 --> 35:16.000
for leading by example

35:16.080 --> 35:17.360
and making us live in reality.

35:18.320 --> 35:19.800
Did you think I wanted to do it?

35:19.880 --> 35:21.240
It's all because I'm unlucky.

35:21.320 --> 35:22.600
If only I could

35:22.680 --> 35:24.160
raise all of you as princesses

35:24.240 --> 35:25.760
and let you live in rainbow bubbles.

35:25.840 --> 35:27.280
Forget it.

35:28.400 --> 35:30.080
Those bubbles will pop with just a touch.

35:30.720 --> 35:33.080
You're escaping from reality
if you're too naive.

35:33.160 --> 35:34.240
He Niaoniao and I

35:34.320 --> 35:35.400
are Liao Tao's daughters.

35:35.480 --> 35:37.840
Both of us grew up overnight
at the age of 12.

35:37.920 --> 35:39.280
Just wait and see.

35:46.520 --> 35:47.440
Enough already.

35:47.520 --> 35:49.040
Stop that. Go to sleep.

35:49.120 --> 35:50.040
Fine.

35:50.640 --> 35:52.760
I have one more quote for you
before I go to sleep.

35:52.840 --> 35:53.680
It's by Goethe.

35:53.760 --> 35:55.200
Is it another famous person?

35:55.720 --> 35:57.280
He's a world-class literary giant.

35:57.360 --> 35:58.560
He once said,

35:58.640 --> 36:01.040
"The eternal feminine draws us on high."

36:02.200 --> 36:04.320
We'll frame it and hang it
in the living room tomorrow.

36:06.640 --> 36:07.520
You're right.

36:08.560 --> 36:10.120
Goethe is truly intelligent.

36:12.640 --> 36:13.640
Go to sleep now.

36:15.360 --> 36:16.480
You should go to sleep too.

36:16.560 --> 36:18.000
You have to wake up early tomorrow.

36:52.040 --> 36:52.960
Zhangyue,

36:54.920 --> 36:56.720
today is the seventh day of your passing.

36:58.000 --> 37:00.320
Our whole family is here

37:01.800 --> 37:03.360
to send you off on your last journey.

37:06.120 --> 37:08.480
This place was the place
you were supposed to come

37:08.560 --> 37:10.120
for the kite-flying contest.

37:11.920 --> 37:13.040
But it's fine.

37:13.760 --> 37:15.200
I know your temper all too well.

37:15.920 --> 37:17.680
The kite-flying contest

37:17.760 --> 37:18.720
doesn't matter to you.

37:19.320 --> 37:20.440
I'm sure you'll be content

37:20.520 --> 37:21.920
as long as our family is harmonious

37:23.120 --> 37:24.160
and peaceful.

37:28.120 --> 37:29.000
Don't worry.

37:30.560 --> 37:31.920
In the days ahead,

37:32.520 --> 37:34.360
we'll live a good life.

37:54.960 --> 37:55.800
Dad,

37:59.280 --> 38:00.880
I've been studying hard lately.

38:03.600 --> 38:04.920
I even read about Newton.

38:06.040 --> 38:07.000
That's why I know

38:07.880 --> 38:09.000
that energy

38:09.080 --> 38:10.360
cannot be created

38:11.720 --> 38:12.800
or destroyed.

38:14.440 --> 38:15.800
It can only change

38:16.920 --> 38:18.400
from one form to another.

38:19.440 --> 38:21.000
All lives that vanish

38:22.400 --> 38:23.880
use their energies

38:23.960 --> 38:25.520
to sustain other living beings.

38:26.400 --> 38:28.720
That's the circle of life.

38:39.440 --> 38:41.080
Edvard Munch once said,

38:42.240 --> 38:43.560
"From my rotting body,

38:44.320 --> 38:45.760
flowers shall grow

38:47.200 --> 38:49.760
and I am in them

38:50.280 --> 38:51.440
and that is eternity."

39:09.640 --> 39:10.520
Therefore,

39:11.720 --> 39:12.600
Dad,

39:13.960 --> 39:15.440
it doesn't matter if you're in Heaven,

39:17.000 --> 39:18.160
under the sea,

39:20.240 --> 39:21.240
or

39:23.080 --> 39:24.560
everywhere around us.

39:25.640 --> 39:28.000
As long as we're on the same planet,

39:29.240 --> 39:30.400
I'll be happy.

39:57.120 --> 39:58.040
Mr. He,

39:59.200 --> 40:01.000
we'll always miss you.

44:17.320 --> 44:24.160
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
